[4.810, "o", "\u001b[35m\u001b[3mcodex\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\nCreated the [measurement memo]( /private/tmp/skills-demo-htma-measure/home/htma-measure-demo/memos/paging-tool-measurement.md).\r\n\r\n- **Central estimate:** about $1,500/year in added revenue loss from switching to chat.\r\n- **Provisional subjective 90% range:** $0–$60,000/year; assumptions are weakly supported.\r\n- **Recommendation:** keep paging unless measurements before renewal establish that expected losses are clearly below $3,600.\r\n\r\nThe most useful next step is reviewing incident acknowledgment and recovery times alongside revenue at those hours. The memo includes assumptions, threshold sensitivity, qualitative value of information, sources, and validated `HTMA_RESULT` JSON.\r\n"]
